Q27. What is MSMP? 
Architect interview favorite. 
 
Executive Answer 

MSMP stands for 
Multi-Step Multi-Process Workflow. 
It is the workflow engine used by SAP GRC Access Control. 
MSMP determines: 
• Approval stages  
• Approval sequence  
• Escalation  
