Q20. How do you customize an ARA Rule Set? 
This is an Architect-level question. 
 
Executive Answer 
I follow a structured governance approach. 

Step 1 
Review SAP Standard Rule Set. 
↓ 
Step 2 
Meet Business Process Owners. 
↓ 
Step 3 
Identify custom business processes. 
↓ 
Step 4 
Map custom transactions. 
↓ 
Step 5 
Create Business Functions. 
